From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pavel Khmelinsky <hmepas@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 12:56:55 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 07/14] Share links with the real server's address behind the
 local proxy

The proxy reports itself as SiteURL so the desktop app stays on localhost, which made copied and
forwarded links point at localhost. Links that leave the webapp now use ProxyUpstreamSiteURL from
the client config, and links to the real server in messages and bookmarks open in this webapp.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
